odd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 7.69995L16 7.69995L16 9.29995L-2.78554e-07 9.29995L-2.08616e-07 7.69995Z\" fill=\"#3D3D3D\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 3\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M-2.08616e-07 0.499999L16 0.5L16 2.5L-2.78554e-07 2.5L-2.08616e-07 0.499999Z\" fill=\"#675AFE\"><\/path><\/svg>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-c29457c6933fc2ee4292\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-2-ba18e46\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6933fc2ee4292\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>Cryptocurrency tracing and recovery face challenges such as the anonymity and pseudonym of transactions, legal and jurisdictional complexities, and technological limitations. Overcoming these obstacles requires innovative approaches, regulatory frameworks, and global collaboration among stakeholders.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-3-ba18e46\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-38e516a6933fc2ee4292\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-38e516a6933fc2ee4292\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-38e516a6933fc2ee4292\">\n                